{"type":"Feature","id":"chicago-event-3","properties":{"name":"55th Street & King Drive, Chicago","point_id":3,"coordinate_note":"derived from Chicago address grid (approximate, +/- ~1-2 blocks)","victim":"\"Gotti\" (Michael Lee, 23)","victim_gang":"8by13 / later \"Gotti World\"","alleged_group":"KTS / Lakeside (alleged)","reliability":"listed as unconfirmed; alleged per street rumor","video_summary":"Described as KTS/Lakeside's first alleged killing. Gotti was shot while sitting in a parked car with a friend who was not in a gang. His set renamed itself \"Gotti World\"; KTS mocked the death with \"Don't go Gotti\" shirts.","video_time":"12:28","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4uyyph017M&t=748s","video_title":"They Had More HATS Than Songs | KTS Von & KTS Dre 'Demon Brothers'","video_caveat":"Narration of unverified street claims and allegations, not confirmed facts."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-87.61815,41.79034]}}
