{"type":"Feature","id":"chicago-event-5","properties":{"name":"79th Street & Eskanaba Avenue, Chicago","point_id":5,"coordinate_note":"derived from Chicago address grid (approximate, +/- ~1-2 blocks)","victim":"\"Big Los\" (33)","victim_gang":"NLMB","alleged_group":"KTS / Lakeside (alleged)","reliability":"disputed; tried but acquitted, no conviction","video_summary":"Big Los, an NLMB OG, was shot from behind as he returned to his porch with coffee and a newspaper. The video frames it as retaliation after a KTS member was hit. Two people were tried and acquitted; a third person later confessed and then recanted.","video_time":"22:13","video_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4uyyph017M&t=1333s","video_title":"They Had More HATS Than Songs | KTS Von & KTS Dre 'Demon Brothers'","video_caveat":"Narration of unverified street claims and allegations, not confirmed facts."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-87.5561,41.75042]}}
